 Wide Web. Su visiÃ³n de conectar informaciÃ³n de forma no lineal inspirÃ³ directamente a los pioneros del hipertexto, como Ted Nelson y Douglas Engelbart</p></li></ul></p><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div data-v-f5d09868="" class="relative"><div data-v-f5d09868="" class="absolute bottom-full inset-x-0 h-4 pointer-events-none z-10" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 0%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 80%);"></div><div data-v-f5d09868="" class="border-dark-text-400 border-solid border-t-0.5 mx-2"></div><section data-v-f5d09868="" class="box-border flex w-full"><div data-v-f5d09868="" data-testid="socialContentTopBar" class="flex flex-row justify-between w-full box-border no-drag gap-1 pt-2 px-3 pb-3"><div class="relative" data-testid="surfacePostReactionEmoji" data-pepin-id="false" data-pepin-trigger="false"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 -m-1"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><div class="relative"><button aria-disabled="false" class="select-none border-none tap-highlight-transparent cursor-pointer font-sans bg-transparent font-semibold focus-visible:outline-hidden py-0 flex items-center justify-center aria-disabled:text-dark-text-400 hover-hover:aria-disabled:text-dark-text-400 focus-visible:ring-grape-500 flex p-0.75! h-6 items-end focus-visible:ring-2 rounded-lg relative z-30 focus-visible:ring-grape-500 text-dark-text-200 active:text-grape-500 hhover:bg-button-light hactive:bg-button-hover-light" aria-label="AÃ±adir reacciÃ³n" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-testid="surfacePostReactionEmojiAddReactionButton"><!----><!----><span data-v-1061efb1="" class="flex items-center justify-center" data-name="add_reaction" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"><svg data-v-1061efb1="" class="fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="18" width="18" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" alt="" style="overflow: visible;">
